    "text": "On March 2, 2024, at approximately 0930 hours, Border Patrol Agent [REDACTED] encountered the subject at a gas station in Monroe, Michigan. The subject stated that he is a citizen of Mexico and that he has no immigration documents. The subject stated that he crossed the river near Laredo, Texas, in June 2019 without inspection. The subject is inadmissible under Section 212(a)(6)(A)(i) of the Immigration and Nationality Act. The subject was processed for a Notice to Appear."
